Description: Stream Deck shows the keyboard shortcuts of the focused window
 Daily Deck turns an Elgato Stream Deck into a context sensitive shortcut
 pad: whenever another application gets the focus, the deck switches to that
 application's profile and shows its shortcuts. Pressing a key sends the
 shortcut, translated for the active keyboard layout.
 .
 Features: application icon across the whole deck, a profile editor with live
 preview on the device, shortcut recording, exchangeable profile files and a
 tray icon for quick settings. Window detection works on GNOME (Wayland and
 X11, via a bundled GNOME Shell extension) and other X11 desktops.
 .
 This package is not affiliated with Elgato or Corsair.
